<main class="admin-main">
  <h1>Správa serverů</h1>

  <div class="filter-tabs">
    <%= link_to "Vše", admin_servers_path, class: @status.blank? ? "active" : "" %>
    <%= link_to "Čekající", admin_servers_path(status: "pending"), class: @status == "pending" ? "active" : "" %>
    <%= link_to "Schválené", admin_servers_path(status: "approved"), class: @status == "approved" ? "active" : "" %>
    <%= link_to "Zamítnuté", admin_servers_path(status: "rejected"), class: @status == "rejected" ? "active" : "" %>
    <%= link_to "Suspendované", admin_servers_path(status: "suspended"), class: @status == "suspended" ? "active" : "" %>
  </div>

  <p class="lede">
    Odměna za zhlédnutí je <%= Payout.format_cents(PayoutPolicy.reward_cents, PayoutPolicy.currency) %>.
    „K vyplacení“ je vše, co server vydělal a ještě nebylo v žádosti o výplatu. „Připraveno“ je z toho část, která už prošla ochrannou lhůtou
    (<%= PayoutPolicy.hold_days %> dní) a kontrolou podvodů.
  </p>

  <div class="table-scroll">
  <table class="admin-table admin-table-compact">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Název</th>
        <th>Vlastník</th>
        <th>Status</th>
        <th>Zhlédnuté reklamy</th>
        <th>K vyplacení</th>
        <th>Z toho připraveno</th>
        <th>V žádosti</th>
        <th>Vyplaceno</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <% currency = PayoutPolicy.currency %>
      <% rows = @servers.map { |server| { server: server, views: server.confirmed_views_count, redeemed: server.redeemed_views_count, owed: server.owed_cents, ready: server.balance_cents, pending: server.pending_payout_cents, paid: server.paid_out_cents } } %>
      <% rows.each do |row| %>
        <% server = row[:server] %>
        <tr class="row-link" data-controller="row-link" data-row-link-url-value="<%= admin_server_path(server) %>" data-action="click->row-link#open">
          <td><%= link_to server.name, admin_server_path(server), class: "row-link-anchor" %></td>
          <td><%= server.user&.email %></td>
          <td>
            <span class="status-badge status-<%= server.status %>">
              <%= server.status %>
            </span>
          </td>
          <td><%= row[:views] %> <span class="lede">(vyzvednuto <%= row[:redeemed] %>)</span></td>
          <td><strong><%= Payout.format_cents(row[:owed], currency) %></strong></td>
          <td><%= Payout.format_cents(row[:ready], currency) %></td>
          <td><%= Payout.format_cents(row[:pending], currency) %></td>
          <td><%= Payout.format_cents(row[:paid], currency) %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
    <tfoot>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="3"><strong>Celkem</strong></td>
        <td><strong><%= rows.sum { |r| r[:views] } %></strong> <span class="lede">(vyzvednuto <%= rows.sum { |r| r[:redeemed] } %>)</span></td>
        <td><strong><%= Payout.format_cents(rows.sum { |r| r[:owed] }, currency) %></strong></td>
        <td><strong><%= Payout.format_cents(rows.sum { |r| r[:ready] }, currency) %></strong></td>
        <td><strong><%= Payout.format_cents(rows.sum { |r| r[:pending] }, currency) %></strong></td>
        <td><strong><%= Payout.format_cents(rows.sum { |r| r[:paid] }, currency) %></strong></td>
      </tr>
    </tfoot>
  </table>
  </div>
</main>